  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 65 poor women to start Beekeeping in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beekeeping is a sustainable, cost-effective, and ecologically friendly way for rural smallholder farmers to generate income and enhance household food security. GivingHope Foundation aims to support 65 rural Ugandan farmers who have expressed interest in developing beekeeping and honey production. This initiative will benefit both their families and the environment. With this project, we seek to establish 195 new beehives and provide technical support to new beekeepers.</narrative>
  </description>
